abstract: >-
  Universal IDTA Submodel Template Editor - a metamodel-driven application
  for editing any IDTA submodel template without code modifications. Features
  include semantic lookup, smart mapping, PDF-to-AAS extraction, PCF calculation,
  and Manufacturing-X dataspace integration.
